==English==
{{wikipedia}}
===Etymology===
Origin uncertain; perhaps a diminutive of {{term|dock}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|/ˈdɒkɪt/}}
* {{rhymes|ɒkɪt}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{context|obsolete|lang=en}} A [[summary]]; a brief [[digest]].
# {{context|legal|lang=en}} A short entry of the [[proceeding]]s of a court; the [[register]] containing them; the [[office]] containing the register.
# {{context|legal|lang=en}} A [[schedule]] of [[case]]s awaiting [[action]] in a [[court]].
# An [[agenda]] of things to be done.
# A [[ticket]] or [[label]] fixed to something, showing its [[content]]s or directions to its [[use]].

