===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# {{context|transitive|lang=en}} To make an entry in a docket.
# {{context|transitive|lang=en}} To [[label]] a [[parcel]] etc.
#: ''to '''docket''' goods''
# {{context|transitive|lang=en}} To make a brief [[abstract]] of (a writing) and [[endorse]] it on the back of the paper, or to endorse the title or contents on the back of; to [[summarize]].
#: ''to '''docket''' letters and papers''
#: {{rfquotek|Chesterfield}}
# {{context|transitive|lang=en}} To make a brief abstract of and inscribe in a book.
#: ''judgments regularly '''docketed'''''
# {{context|transitive|lang=en}} To enter or inscribe in a docket, or list of causes for trial.

